# Hardware Proxy

# eufyMake printer documentation; direct page/style samples were slow or timed out.
# https://wiki.eufymake.com/en/home
DOMAIN,wiki.eufymake.com

# ASUS ROG / Armoury Crate update API (/service/update2); retain the current proxy path.
# GET returns 405 on direct and proxy paths; device-specific update requests are unverified.
# https://rog-forum.asus.com/t5/armoury-crate/rogliveservice-update-fails/td-p/1044038
DOMAIN,rog-live-service.asus.com

# KeebTalk mechanical keyboard forum; actual topic-page transfers favor proxy routing.
# https://www.keebtalk.com/about
DOMAIN,www.keebtalk.com
DOMAIN,www\.keebtalk.com

# Linus Tech Tips hardware forum; automated probes receive an access challenge on all paths.
# No valid page-transfer sample supports changing the existing proxy path to direct.
# https://linustechtips.com/
DOMAIN,linustechtips.com

# NVIDIA Developer Forums: repeated topic-list transfers were faster through proxies.
# Keep the exact forum host separate from NVIDIA metrics and telemetry endpoints.
# https://forums.developer.nvidia.com/
DOMAIN,forums.developer.nvidia.com

# GIGABYTE website: retain proxy routing; automated page requests returned 403
# on both direct and proxy paths, so no direct-performance advantage was verified.
DOMAIN,www.gigabyte.com
DOMAIN,www\.gigabyte.com
